# Committed on purpose. A VAPID public key is public by definition — it is
# handed to the browser's push service on every subscribe. The matching private
# key lives in Supabase Vault and is never in this repo.
#
# This file is for LOCAL builds only. The Netlify deploy CLI strips .env from
# the upload, so the same value is also set as a Netlify environment variable.
# Change it in both places or the deployed app subscribes with an empty key.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=BF0wf_VsZQyY-aEGl5S4ZONQcSdtsWxCEBUo-KOHmRq9OVJvvqtYXkqVASQ2HToIUT8XJQRGlyX9X5rPGDzuczQ
